    <briefdescription>
<para>Sanity checks for the versions written into a generated <javadoccode>gradle/libs.versions.toml</javadoccode>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Regression coverage for the auto-updated IntelliJ/VS Code plugin baking its own publication build-id (base + UTC timestamp, e.g. <javadoccode>0.4.4-SNAPSHOT.20260526090539</javadoccode>) into the catalog, which is not a resolvable Maven/Gradle coordinate. The catalog must only ever pin a real XTC version: <javadoccode>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</javadoccode> optionally with <javadoccode>-SNAPSHOT</javadoccode>, <javadoccode>-alpha</javadoccode>, or <javadoccode>-beta</javadoccode> <ndash/> and nothing else. Both the snapshot dependency and a &quot;real&quot; (released) dependency must work. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
